          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 8 | Part-II"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.089,
            0.847,
            0.147
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For the USA, the increase from 2022 to 2023 is more than from 2023 to 2024. We can say this by looking at how steep the line segments are — the steeper the line is, the greater the increase."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.152,
            0.697,
            0.175
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Which of the following statements are valid inferences?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.178,
            0.845,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• From 2012 till 2024, the worldwide count of space object launches increased every year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.221,
            0.846,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "USA is a major contributor in the years 2022 – 24, launching about 3th of the worldwide count."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.265,
            0.739,
            0.286
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Nepal did not launch any object in the period 2012 – 24."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.289,
            0.845,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The combined count of object launches by China and Russia in 2024 is about 400."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.335,
            0.845,
            0.375
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Identify two consecutive years where the worldwide count increased by 2 times or more."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.392,
            0.833,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Imagine the same data being shown as a clustered column graph. There would be 13 clusters  — one for each year — and within each cluster, 4 columns, making a total of 52 bars! Such a graph would look crowded and difficult to read, making it hard to interpret the trends clearly."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.466,
            0.834,
            0.56
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "A line graph, on the other hand, is better suited for illustrating changes over time. By connecting data points with line segments, it provides a clear visual representation of trends and variations, allowing the reader to easily track how a parameter evolves across different years."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.583,
            0.479,
            0.605
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Catch the (Pattern in) Rain"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
